{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:0b47e2dd142a9955","name":"Nikto","source":{"id":"source:reference-0b47e2dd142a9955","title":"Nikto","revision":21395,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:43:24Z","sha256":"20c7bf6c23ff90a25cab0e35a9bfec153adf2a6196d5f180b7a0e60b280854b6","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21395","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Nikto&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-0b47e2dd142a9955","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Widely recognized as a slave species of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hutts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hutts"},", the Nikto have served their masters since before the founding of ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"},", proving to be cunning warriors in the Hutts' battle with the legendary conqueror ",{"tag":"a","children":["Xim the Despot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Xim_the_Despot?action=edit&redlink=1"},". Wherever the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hutts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hutts"}," are, the Nikto are never far behind. Because of their homeworld's radioactive atmosphere, the Nikto have five distinct subspecies, each adapted to a specific type of terrain (see the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nikto Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nikto_Survival","referenceId":"reference:84541654450d2a7d"}," feat).\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Nikto Characteristics"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Personality:"]}," Although lacking in personal charisma, Nikto posses a single-minded tenacity that makes them excellent followers. Eons of enslavement by the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hutts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hutts"}," have left them more comfortable with taking orders from their masters than with thinking on their feet.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Physical Description:"]}," Tough, leathery skin and a lack of extensive facial muscles limit the range of Nikto facial expression.  Their deep black eyes further enhance their reptilian appearance. A Nikto's subspecies can be determined by his or her skin tone and the presence of small spikes or horns. A typical Nikto stands at 1.8 meters tall and weighs 60 kilograms.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Age Groups"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Age_Groups"},":"]}," Nikto age at the following stages:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["CHILD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["YOUNG ADULT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["ADULT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["MIDDLE AGE\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["OLD\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["VENERABLE\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":["1-10 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["11-15 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["16-35 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["36-54 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["55-64 Years\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["65+ Years\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Homeworld:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Kintan"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Kintan?action=edit&redlink=1"},", a radioactive planet located within Hutt Space in ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Outer Rim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Outer_Rim?action=edit&redlink=1"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," All Nikto learn to read, speak, and write their own Nikto language along with either Basic or Huttese.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Example Names:"]}," Bok, Fi-Ek Sirch, Giran, Klaatu, Ma'kis'shaalas, Nysad, Wooof.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Adventurers:"]}," Nikto have the tenacity to pursue any career, but their status as a slave Species to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hutts"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hutts"}," forces them into roles as guards and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldiers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldiers"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Nikto Species Traits"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Nikto share the following Species Traits:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Ability Modifiers:"]}," All Nikto receive a +2 bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Strength"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Strength"},", but suffer -2 penalties to both their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Charisma"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Charisma"},". Nikto are tough and hardened, but their subservient status stunts their willpower and creativity."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Medium Size:"]}," As Medium creatures, Nikto have no special bonuses or penalties due to their size."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Speed:"]}," Nikto have a base speed of 6 squares."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Great Fortitude:"]}," Nikto gain a +2 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species","referenceId":"reference:56205e12c20fb568"}," bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},", having evolved to survive the harsh environment of their homeworld."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Natural Armor:"]}," A Nikto's tough hide provides a +2 Natural Armor bonus to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},". A Natural Armor bonus stacks with an Armor bonus."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Survival Instinct:"]}," A Nikto can choose to reroll any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Survival","referenceId":"reference:8302496de0ace160"}," check, but the result of the reroll must be accepted, even if it is worse."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Automatic Languages:"]}," All Nikto can speak, read, and write Nikto, as well as either Basic or Huttese (chosen at ",{"tag":"a","children":["Character Creation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Character_Creation","referenceId":"reference:b7d7c41a3cea84bb"},")."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Nikto Species Feats"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Nikto characters have access to the following ",{"tag":"a","children":["Species Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Species_Feat"},". No Species Feats are considered Bonus Feats for any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heroic Class"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heroic_Class"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"th","children":["SPECIES FEAT\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"th","children":["BENEFITS\n"]}]},"\n",{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Nikto Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nikto_Survival","referenceId":"reference:84541654450d2a7d"},"\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"td","children":["Reroll ",{"tag":"a","children":["Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Survival","referenceId":"reference:8302496de0ace160"}," checks in native environment.\n"]}]}]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
